2026-10-31T00:00:13Z (RFD66606-2428) 'Migration recipe (per model)
 # tags: rfd:details-heading
 Text:RFD2428  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-31T00:00:14Z (RFD66606-2428) 'Same recipe RFD66606-2229 named as the interchangeable-parts consolidation shape, one row per consumer:
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2428  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-31T00:00:15Z (RFD66606-2428) '1. **Q4 quantize**, QAT if we train the model, PTQ per the CLAUDE.md Post-training-quantization blocklist exemption (a vendor's own runtime is exempt from the QAT-only rule) otherwise. Target Q4_0 for text models, Q4_K_M for vision if the K-quant produces a measurable EditScore win over Q4_0 on held-out inputs.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2428  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-31T00:00:16Z (RFD66606-2428) '2. **GGUF conversion**, via llama.cpp's `convert_hf_to_gguf.py` for HF-hosted models, per-model script for non-HF checkpoints. Ports for `Wan-VACE`, `Pixal3D`, `MoGe-3`, `rf-detr-Seg`, `LaMa`, `Qwen3-TTS`, `Parakeet`, `Voxtral`, `wav2vec2`, `allosaurus`, `WavLM` all follow this step.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2428  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-31T00:00:17Z (RFD66606-2428) '3. **ZSTD-SQLite bundle**, RFD66606-2214 shape, `sqlite3_open()` on local disk. One `.zstd.sqlite` per model bundle, install-time download via the release channel.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2428  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-31T00:00:18Z (RFD66606-2428) '4. **`Ggml.load_model()` GDExtension call**, RFD66606-2230 surface, the native `modules/ggml/` module hands bytes to ggml.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2428  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-31T00:00:19Z (RFD66606-2428) '5. **GDScript adapter**, per-model `.gd` file at `res://adapters/<name>.gd`, extends `GgmlAdapter`, defines `format_prompt` / `decode_output` / `apply_lora` per model quirks.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2428  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-31T00:00:20Z (RFD66606-2428) '6. **Docker image**, per RFD66606-1036 `/health` + `/predict` shape still applies, the container binary is now the native Godot binary + shared `modules/ggml/` + the model's ZSTD-SQLite bundle + adapter `.gd`. One model per image (packaging stays RFD66606-1036), one runtime across images.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2428  1 LINE
 Text:Written
